From 5b7840816f2865ec17508c8861724e887bc42956 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mikko Gronoff <mikko.gronoff@qt.io>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 11:05:01 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] recipes: update LICENSE to SPDX Expression syntax
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Converted to new syntax by running openembedded-core/scripts/contrib/convert-spdx-licenses.py
on the layer. Conversion issue:

"ERROR:51: Invalid expression for parentheses
The-Qt-Company-Commercial  OR  (GPL-3.0-only  AND  Qt-GPL-exception-1.0)
                                                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^"

resolved by manually adjusting "(GPL-3.0-only & Qt-GPL-exception-1.0)"
to "(GPL-3.0-only WITH Qt-GPL-exception-1.0)" where applicable.

Change-Id: Id1729dbaeb24172f0f868c4ae0e2eb70294bf0bd
Reviewed-by: Jouni Äijälä <jouni.aijala@qt.io>

(cherry picked from commit 675695eb on the dev branch; backported to 6.12
for oe-core blacksail, whose license parser requires SPDX syntax. Conflict
in qtwayland_git.bb resolved by converting the 6.12 expression.)
